The Checkmk agent provides operating system data such as CPU,
memory, file systems, ZFS, network interfaces and processes to a
Checkmk server, which evaluates them with its built-in checks.

This plugin runs the agent from the check_mk_agent package on TCP
port 6556, with optional encryption. Use firewall rules to allow
the port only from the Checkmk server.

I did not develop this plugin officially as an employee of Checkmk
GmbH, but rather as a private individual.

